<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113966" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῑάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>play the Chian</i>: esp. <i>imitate the Chian
			musician</i> Democritus, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				912
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.65
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χῑάζω,</span>
			<i>mark with two lines crossing like a</i> X:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷα δυσὶ γραμμαῖς κεχιασμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					2.58
				</span></i>
			: esp. of words or lines in which the critic wishes to point
			out something remarkable, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δὲ τοιοῦτον
				κεχίασται</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				201
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιάζεται ὁ στίχος</span> (in
			allusion to the word <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἑλένη</span>)
				Sch.<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				81
			</span></i>, etc.; absurdly expld. by <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1462.41
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Rhet.,
				<i>arrange four clauses crosswise,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				4.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>in Cat.</u>
				79.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>make a cruciform incision,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.20.31
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιεζοῦμεν</span> codd.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>cross out, cancel</i> a document, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFlor.</u>
				61.65
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1282.34
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>, etc.</div>
